{"type":"META","ticket":384,"id":"META"}||{"title":"Generic_TFT_H013A6QQIGC5N10","tags":[],"source":"","images":[],"attributes":{"Symbol":"5ef59b5f0de89ae6","Footprint":"","Description":"One HOTHMI bare round GC9A01 display, no touchscreen; plugs directly through10pin FPC J8. PanelVCI3.2+/-0.2V; older supplied GC9A01 chip operatingmax3.3V. Target3.192V and measure3.0..3.3V; SPI uses same rail. Manufacturer advertises3.3V MCU compatibility but internalIOVCC wiring not provided: logic compatibility remains sample-validation assumption, no absolute guarantee. TE pin8 unused. Backlight Vf3.0..3.4V at40mA specification, use68ohm derated5V resistor and low-side PWM. Contact surface faces same side as display; frontviewtaildown pin10left/pin1right. Verify purchased exact no-touch revision and FPC fit before power.","Name":"Generic_TFT_H013A6QQIGC5N10","Designator":"DS?","Value":"TFT-H013A6QQIGC5N10","UserDocLink":"https://www.hothmi.com/product/1-3-inch-circular-display-240x240-gc9a01/","Comment":"TFT-H013A6QQIGC5N10","MPN":"TFT-H013A6QQIGC5N10","Manufacturer":"HOTHMI","Catalog_Status":"official_panel_V2_drawing_checked_candidate","Catalog_URL":"https://www.hothmi.com/product/1-3-inch-circular-display-240x240-gc9a01/","Design_Notes":"One HOTHMI bare round GC9A01 display, no touchscreen; plugs directly through10pin FPC J8. PanelVCI3.2+/-0.2V; older supplied GC9A01 chip operatingmax3.3V. Target3.192V and measure3.0..3.3V; SPI uses same rail. Manufacturer advertises3.3V MCU compatibility but internalIOVCC wiring not provided: logic compatibility remains sample-validation assumption, no absolute guarantee. TE pin8 unused. Backlight Vf3.0..3.4V at40mA specification, use68ohm derated5V resistor and low-side PWM. Contact surface faces same side as display; frontviewtaildown pin10left/pin1right. Verify purchased exact no-touch revision and FPC fit before power.","Footprint_Candidate_Status":"offboard_panel_no_pcb_footprint","Assembly_Location":"ENCLOSURE_OFFBOARD_NOT_PCB","Selecti